      "math_academy_id": "e-4435",
      "problem": "Calculate $\\det(A),$ if ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14272902/assets/6d3831e5966ce4b783cae2e5e49acf8888558ee13d8c205458d96f6f36ef6b5a.svg)",
      "worked_solution": "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14272902/assets/43e6f7e88c5846d1c74bf7209ff92000e2a760ab0ce2eb93e3651234c4b92d5c.svg)\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{3}-(-2)\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
